WEBVTT

00:01:29.621 --> 00:01:33.288
and I began documenting the moments
that felt most precious to me.

00:01:34.038 --> 00:01:35.871
With a camera in hand,

00:01:35.913 --> 00:01:39.329
I learned the art of deciding
what to include in the frame

00:01:39.371 --> 00:01:41.454
and what to let blur into the background.

00:01:42.829 --> 00:01:45.288
I graduated high school.
I went to college.

00:01:45.329 --> 00:01:48.579
I studied a combination
of psychology and art.

00:01:48.621 --> 00:01:51.496
No shortage of feelings there,
I can assure you.

00:01:52.746 --> 00:01:53.996
And then ...

00:01:55.246 --> 00:01:56.538
I got sick.

00:01:57.454 --> 00:01:59.079
Not in a dramatic way.

00:01:59.121 --> 00:02:00.954
I didn't start screaming in agony